  "en": "Ai: Geez! What the heck!? Pinching someone's cheek out of nowhere--what's the big idea!?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5603,
  "text_len": 48
 },
 {
  "id": "sce220:01617",
  "jp": "トウヤ「それそれ」",
  "off": 5655,
  "len": 12,
  "en": "Touya: That's it, that's it.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5657,
  "text_len": 9
 },
 {
  "id": "sce220:01638",
  "jp": "アイ「はぁ？」",
  "off": 5688,
  "len": 11,
  "en": "Ai: Huh?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5690,
  "text_len": 8
 },
 {
  "id": "sce220:01646",
  "jp": "トウヤ「そのほうがお前らしいぜ」",
  "off": 5702,
  "len": 20,
  "en": "Touya: That's more like you.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5704,
  "text_len": 17
 },
 {
  "id": "sce220:0166F",
  "jp": "アイ「なに言って‥‥あっ」",
  "off": 5743,
  "len": 19,
  "en": "Ai: What are you talking ab-- Oh.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5745,
  "text_len": 16
 },
 {
  "id": "sce220:01685",
  "jp": "トウヤ「そう簡単に悲しみを忘れることはできねぇ。{nl}　だったら向き合っていけばいい。{nl}　一人で無理なら頼ればいい。{nl}　一人より二人。そのための仲間だろ？」",
  "off": 5765,
  "len": 97,
  "en": "Touya: You can't forget sadness that easily. So face it instead. If you can't do it alone, lean on someone. Two's better than one. That's what friends are for, right?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5767,
  "text_len": 94
 },
 {
  "id": "sce220:016F1",
  "jp": "アイ「‥‥うん‥‥あ、ありがとう‥‥」",
  "off": 5873,
  "len": 28,
  "en": "Ai: ...Yeah... Th-thank you...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5875,
  "text_len": 25
 },
 {
  "id": "sce220:01710",
  "jp": "トウヤ「お、おい‥‥」",
  "off": 5904,
  "len": 16,
  "en": "Touya: H-hey...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5906,
  "text_len": 13
 },
 {
  "id": "sce220:0172E",
  "jp": "アイ「えへへ、ごめん。{nl}　なんだかあんたの前で泣いてばかりだね」",
  "off": 5934,
  "len": 37,
  "en": "Ai: Ehehe, sorry. Seems like all I ever do is cry in front of you.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5936,
  "text_len": 34
 },
 {
  "id": "sce220:01756",
  "jp": "トウヤ「ま、まあ、俺でよかったらいつでも{nl}　相談に乗るからな」",
  "off": 5974,
  "len": 38,
  "en": "Touya: W-well, if I'll do, you can come talk to me anytime.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 5976,
  "text_len": 35
 },
 {
  "id": "sce220:0179B",
  "jp": "アイ「うん。そうする」",
  "off": 6043,
  "len": 14,
  "en": "Ai: Yeah. I will.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6045,
  "text_len": 11
 },
 {
  "id": "sce220:017AC",
  "jp": "トウヤ「おう。それじゃあな」",
  "off": 6060,
  "len": 17,
  "en": "Touya: Yeah. See ya.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6062,
  "text_len": 14
 },
 {
  "id": "sce220:017CB",
  "jp": "アイ「‥‥じゃ」",
  "off": 6091,
  "len": 13,
  "en": "Ai: ...Bye.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6093,
